cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "White Hole: 3D Spacetime Simulation"
abstract: >-
  An interactive browser visualisation of a white hole, the time reverse of a
  black hole. A particle disk spirals outwards and cools from blue-white to red,
  polar jets and periodic shock waves leave the centre, and screen-space
  gravitational lensing bends the background. Users can throw asteroids that are
  pulled in by gravity but pushed back before reaching the horizon, trigger a
  burst, and tune outflow, spin, time flow, bloom, lensing and particle count.
  English and Turkish interfaces.
authors:
